Historical material retained for reference, not a current roadmap or
supported implementation.  Original file contents and dates may describe
features and plans that have since changed.

changelog/  Older hand-written ChangeLogs, formerly in old/.
plans/      Design discussions from PLANS/, the old TODO list, and the
            former NEWS-future proposals for Automake 2.0.
testing/    The experimental Perl TAP driver, formerly in contrib/.
            The maintained TAP driver is lib/tap-driver.sh.

These files remain in source distributions.  New development proposals
belong on the Automake mailing list and bug tracker, not in this archive.
